      {
        "text": "U.S. Geological Survey Area Species Management Research Program (ARMI) accepts any uploaded file and stores the file under '/uploads/{upload-file}'. A remote, authenticated attacker could upload a crafted PHP file that executes and returns command output from the server when accessed.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed on 2026-07-20.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
